{"id":7474,"date":"2021-04-21T14:56:51","date_gmt":"2021-04-21T18:56:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7474"},"modified":"2021-04-23T15:05:18","modified_gmt":"2021-04-23T19:05:18","slug":"just-a-little-hike","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/04\/21\/just-a-little-hike\/","title":{"rendered":"Just a little hike"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Once we kind of found our way around the county (grocery store etc.), we decided to do a little more roaming within the park. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Today was a short hike up to Eagles Point.\u00a0 From here you can see a large portion of the lake, some of the islands (including<a href=\"https:\/\/kentuckystatepolice.org\/trooper-island\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> trooper island<\/a>), and on over to Tennessee.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Although the trail (from the Marina overflow parking lot) is only 7\/10ths of a mile, much of it was uphill and my hip and knee were both crying out to me along the way.  We heard a lot of little critters among the leaves in the woods as we climbed up to Eagle&#8217;s Point, but all we saw was a black snake along the way.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Once we got to the top, it became clear that the climb was worth the trip.  We could see clearly (even though it was an overcast day) over to the lodge, to <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/kentuckystatepolice.org\/trooper-island\/\" target=\"_blank\">Troopers Island<\/a>, and on across the lake to Tennessee.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Trooper Island is owned by the Army Corps of Engineers and leased by the Kentucky State Police where they operate a camp for underprivileged children.  Find out more about their mission <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/kentuckystatepolice.org\/trooper-island\/\" target=\"_blank\">by following this link<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I&#8217;ve been afraid of heights ever since I can remember.  A 6&#8242; stepladder is about as high as I can comfortably go.  Kathy on the other hand &#8230;. is comfortable going right to the edge (as you can see in one of the pictures below)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_131515299.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_131515299.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7476\" class=\"wp-image-7476\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_131515299.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_131515299-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_131515299-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133014558.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133014558.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7477\" class=\"wp-image-7477\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133014558.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133014558-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133014558-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The trail climbing to the top<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133535261.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133535261.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7478\" class=\"wp-image-7478\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133535261.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133535261-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133535261-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Kathy&#8217;s too close to the edge<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133743958.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133743958.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7479\" class=\"wp-image-7479\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133743958.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133743958-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133743958-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Trooper Island<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_135316733_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_135316733_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7480\" class=\"wp-image-7480\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_135316733_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_135316733_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_135316733_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">At the Eagle&#8217;s Point overlook<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">Click on any of the thumbnail images above to see a larger picture<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133833756.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"160\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133833756.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7481\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133833756.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133833756-300x63.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/IMG_20210416_133833756-685x144.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Panoramic view from the top (Trooper Island in the distance)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Dale Hollow Lake State Resort Park Eagle Point Video\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/n5NYEiDQ2tI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><figcaption>Video from the top<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>That&#8217;s it for now &#8230; we have very limited wifi here.  I have to come up to the lodge to get any reliable wifi. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Stay safe &#8230; Herb &amp; Kathy<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p